<title>UK: RTRS-Australia/NZ wool prices for September.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia/NZ wool prices for September.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commonwealth Secretariat estimated Australian and New Zealand wool prices for September as follows, in pence per kilo clean, cif UK dry-combed.</p>
<p>    70s 504	  64s 369	  60s 293	  58s 269</p>
<p>    56s 263	  50s 242	  48s 238	  46s 234</p>
<p>Prices are based on quotations from sales in Australia and New Zealand and represent unweighted average for super, good and average fleeces and skirting (free and light burry). Quotes for 56s and coarser are confined to New Zealand wools.</p>
</text>
